WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.875
Hey, guys, the new celebration rules are up!

00:00:01.875 --> 00:00:04.208
Yeah! We can use the ball as a prop

00:00:04.208 --> 00:00:06.000
Yo! We can do group dances

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.083
No way! We can dance on the ground

00:00:08.083 --> 00:00:09.838
But guys, we still can't do sex moves

00:00:12.663 --> 00:00:15.431
OK, G-Men, clearly you need me

00:00:15.431 --> 00:00:17.460
To choreograph our celebrations

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:21.415
Now let's show this league how New York City does dance

00:00:21.415 --> 00:00:22.401
If we ever score

00:00:22.401 --> 00:00:24.485
Well, now hold on—maybe I should be the leader

00:00:24.485 --> 00:00:26.695
because I'm uh the Quarterback

00:00:26.695 --> 00:00:29.426
Yeah, and where do quarterbacks go?

00:00:29.426 --> 00:00:30.462
Behind the linemen

00:00:30.462 --> 00:00:31.795
But they can't see me back here

00:00:31.795 --> 00:00:33.534
Trust me, it's for your protection

00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:35.801
And one, and two and McAdoo!

00:00:35.801 --> 00:00:39.163
Step right. Lean back. Giant step left. And shimmy

00:00:39.163 --> 00:00:41.713
C’mon, Big Blue, keep it high and tight

00:00:41.713 --> 00:00:42.959
Nice, Brandon

00:00:42.959 --> 00:00:45.075
Eli, stay in the pocket

00:00:45.075 --> 00:00:47.500
Ok now get on the turnpike

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:49.791
And hitchhike left. Now hitchhike right

00:00:49.791 --> 00:00:51.916
Come on, Flowers, we need you to get low

00:00:51.916 --> 00:00:53.166
Bend those knees

00:00:53.166 --> 00:00:54.544
OK now, 2-minute drill

00:00:54.544 --> 00:00:56.370
Let's give them that big Broadway finish

00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:57.616
With those jazz hands

00:00:57.616 --> 00:00:59.446
Let's see those jazz hands, JPP

